    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "title": "hoopstuck-2024-03-22-0058.mp3",
    "text": "my earlobes are sore when i dream of you\ni fell to the floor when i thought about what we've been through\nall that's before feels like a mere excuse\nhere to explore, what's there in store (i want more)\nnow im tossing and turning\nspeaking without discerning\nfinding nothing i'm searching,\nnothing is working\nall my clothes are still dirty\nstay in bed til 230\nhow's this shit reaffirming",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/29723273",
    "published_at": "2024-07-31T15:07:18.000Z",
