  {
    "id": "arena:61990886",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "title": "if-you-wanna-start-it-2024-07-25-0220.mp3",
    "text": "bitch i'm not the one who decides if u stay or go\nif you wanna start it we can party at the slayyyter show\nlisten to the songs that you got me to hate the most\nwe can hit the bars and crash your car into your favorite pole\nwe got the moves,\nwe got the bends\nthis is not a lifestyle that your father would recommend\nwe break the rules,\nwe don't make amends\nyou can call your daddy when the night ends\nhey, watch the people judge you\nwait, nothing's changed it's just you\nthe same bullshit in those bright rooms\nfollows you into the dark too",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/29615144",
